hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"49","[AI-translation] Ummi Hisham bint Harithah bin An-Nu'man se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine { Qaaf wal Quranil Majeed } Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peechhe se hi seekha, wo is ki tilawat Subah ki namaz mein karte the."
"50","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdur-Rahman se, Amrah ki ek behan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine { Qaaf wal Quranil Majeed } Jumme ke din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke munh se seekha, jab wo har Jumme ko mimbar par is ki tilawat karte the."
"51","[AI-translation] Harithah bin An-Nu'man ki beti se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine { Qaaf wal Quranil Majeed } Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke munh se yaad kiya, jab wo Jumme ke din mimbar par the."
